{"about_the_game":"<strong>Cardboard Town</strong> is a city-building card game where you manage resources, upgrade buildings, and navigate random events to build the ultimate tabletop metropolis.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198070/extras/22de0643e5fc84dc1af1eab5db119899.poster.avif?t=1770863700\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198070/extras/22de0643e5fc84dc1af1eab5db119899.webm?t=1770863700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198070/extras/22de0643e5fc84dc1af1eab5db119899.mp4?t=1770863700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Cardboard Town has a charmingly aesthetic and hand-drawn art style, but you aren't just mindlessly placing buildings to make a pretty skyline; you are actively managing a complex economy where every decision matters. Every card you play impacts your delicate balance of Water, Electricity, and Safety. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198070/extras/12082de4a3cb7fbddc819a0bdd53c566.poster.avif?t=1770863700\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198070/extras/12082de4a3cb7fbddc819a0bdd53c566.webm?t=1770863700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198070/extras/12082de4a3cb7fbddc819a0bdd53c566.mp4?t=1770863700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a1 The Gameplay Loop</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Draw Your Hand:</strong> Each turn gives you new options. Will you expand your residential district or upgrade your power grid?<br></li><li> <strong>Manage Your Stats:</strong> Keep an eye on your <strong>Money, Electricity, Water, Environment,</strong> and <strong>Safety</strong>. If your population grows too fast without the infrastructure to support it, things get messy.<br></li><li> <strong>Survive the Chaos:</strong> Random disasters and events will test your planning. Do you have the Action Cards to save the day?<br></li><li> <strong>Unlock &amp; Upgrade:</strong> Earn persistent rewards after every run to beef up your deck for the next attempt.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198070/extras/97e3b06a1fe09f2c63d574ccbd7ce318.poster.avif?t=1770863700\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198070/extras/97e3b06a1fe09f2c63d574ccbd7ce318.webm?t=1770863700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198070/extras/97e3b06a1fe09f2c63d574ccbd7ce318.mp4?t=1770863700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udccf A Massive Deck of Possibilities</h2>With over <strong>300+ Building, Action, Quest cards, Festivals, and Upgrades, the combinations are endless. You might build an eco-friendly green paradise in one run, and an industrial powerhouse in the next.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Various building cards to build your city from the ground up<br></li><li> Action cards to take care of random events and adjust your cards<br></li><li> Quest cards to complete and make your people happy<br></li><li> Road cards to make cars go <i>wroom wroom</i></li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198070/extras/12c76e784fd0fb6962c8cc9303dfc6c2.poster.avif?t=1770863700\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198070/extras/12c76e784fd0fb6962c8cc9303dfc6c2.webm?t=1770863700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198070/extras/12c76e784fd0fb6962c8cc9303dfc6c2.mp4?t=1770863700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udea8 Three Strikes, You're Out!</h2>The stakes are real. Failing to manage your stats or resolve disasters results in a <strong>Red Alert</strong>. Accumulate three Red Alerts, and it\u2019s Game Over. Can you beat your high score before the city folds?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Roguelite Fun</h2>With different upgrades, random festivals, disasters, and quests; each run is different! Try to beat your high score each time and unlock even more random stuff such as new building cards, festivals, cosmetics and even resources!<br><br><i>Build your cardboard empire today!</i></strong>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"What does this do?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2198070/93e69b8e32b30e669d87b4e68bd9680ab8335cb3.jpg"},{"name":"Cardboard Village","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2198070/30caa1c3cf9f970f779c373a432978f6e9a1da32.jpg"},{"name":"Cardboard City","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2198070/e1a9f1bcbd2536740dd061d015ee02ef577e12b8.jpg"},{"name":"Cardboard Metropolis","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2198070/bfecf7d7284a1738d451eeb105a48c520f6a06c0.jpg"},{"name":"Completionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2198070/dc903d1c42e830a3ef3235aa2cdc35c6e57e91bc.jpg"},{"name":"First Chapter Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2198070/764cef76cf754df5ce83bc26f80782213a1bcc97.jpg"},{"name":"Golden Real Estate","pat